{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"Contact is now verified: extending into a token line pushes the whole line one cell; an immediate retraction does not pull it. The earlier legs’ “hook at the wall” behavior is therefore the next key test—how many pushes create ownership, how retraction compacts the train, and whether the owned train follows the collector across lanes."}}
